.vercel
.env*.local
.refonte-backup-*

# Supplier product images persisted by the local-filesystem fallback of
# `persistSupplierProductImage`. Every `npm test` run exercises that path
# through the store-creator E2E suite, so these pile up on each run. The
# real assets (R2 in prod) never land here; the committed run-*/current
# fixtures under public/generated/ stay tracked and are unaffected.
public/generated/*/products/
